# TrivioQ Project Rules (Claude)

This project uses a monorepo structure with Turbo and Yarn.

## Architecture
- **Naming**: All filenames must be lowercase and hyphen-separated (kebab-case).
- `apps/api`: Express (Backend)
- `apps/mobile`: React Native (Mobile)
- `apps/web`: Next.js (Web)
- `apps/admin`: Next.js (Admin)
- `packages/database`: Prisma + PostgreSQL
- `packages/shared-types`: Shared Zod/TS types

## Guidelines
- **Strict TypeScript**: No `any`, use strict types.
- **Localization (i18n)**: Localize all user-facing strings. No hardcoded text in components.
- **Prisma**: Always run `npx prisma generate` after schema changes.
- **UI**: Modern, premium aesthetics using Tailwind (Web) and StyleSheet (Mobile).
- **Validation**: Zod for all API boundaries.
- **Workflow**: Research -> Plan -> Execute -> Verify.

Refer to `.cursorrules` for full detailed instructions.
